# Signing keys never live in the tree
signing/
*.pem
*.key

# Catalogue generations are build output. The development generation is the exception: it is a
# signed fixture, produced with a development key, that the core repository's sync tests read.
# A generation a build replaced is left beside it under a dotted name, and is build output too.
/snapshots/*
!/snapshots/README.md
!/snapshots/development/
/snapshots/.*
